flowchart TD
  Incident --> Kill[Server kill + hold affected writes]
  Kill --> Queue[Pause/checkpoint queues; reconcile in-flight]
  Queue --> Policy[Disable scoped feature; invalidate policy cache]
  Policy --> Compatible{Known-good release schema-compatible?}
  Compatible -->|yes| App[Rollback app/functions/workers independently]
  Compatible -->|no| Repair[Held mode + forward repair / isolated restore]
  Repair --> Verify[Reconcile DB + object bytes + access + external records]
  App --> Verify
  Verify --> Review[Tests + operated checks + fresh approvals]
  Review --> Resume[Scoped reactivation]
